[Patterns]
I am * => STATE_RESPONSE => FEELING
I feel * => STATE_RESPONSE => FEELING
I need * => NEED_RESPONSE => NEED
I want * => WANT_RESPONSE => DESIRE
my * => FAMILY_RESPONSE => FAMILY
because * => REASON_RESPONSE => REASON
* => GENERAL_RESPONSE
End

[Reflections]
am => are
was => were
i => you
I'd => you would
I'd => you would
I've => you have
I'll => you will
my => your
you've => I have
you'll => I will
your => my
yours => mine
you => me
me => you
End

[Quit Words]
bye
quit
exit
End
